  "description": "Mocha – Adventure-Ready Tandem for Rugged Terrain and Touring\nThe Mocha Tandem offers smooth handling and outstanding stability mile after mile, making it the perfect choice for adventure-minded riders. Handcrafted with made-to-order quality, the Mocha is built for unwavering performance, whether you're touring with a full load or riding without. Designed for 650b wheels, this tandem is ideal for unpaved adventures, touring, and fun rides, with special attention given to ensuring smaller riders enjoy the ride too.\nKey Features:\n\nOptimized for 27.5\" (650b) wheels with 45-60mm (2.3\") tires for versatility on unpaved roads and trails\n\nCo-Motion oversize zonally-butted chromoly tubing for a lightweight yet durable frame\n\nOversized 44mm head tube\n\nUnicrown touring fork, with triple braze-ons, for stability and precise handling\n\nProven Co-Motion touring geometry for a comfortable long-distance ride\n\nRack & fender mounts and dual disc brakes for smooth, controlled riding and added load capacity\n\nHand-built Boost thru-axle wheels for strength and durability on tough terrain\n\nMountain handlebar option for a more upright, comfortable riding position\n\nDrivetrain options: Shimano 2x11, Rohloff, or Pinion for versatile shifting performance\n\nChoose from road drop bars or mountain/trekking handlebars (Jones H-Bar is awesome on this bike!) based on your preferred riding style. The Mocha Tandem ensures adventure-ready performance on any terrain, with a smooth, comfortable ride that’s built to last.\n\nComplete bike starting at $5,695.00\nConfigure custom features and price options below\n\nClick here to get your Co-Motion\nMocha order started!",
